Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Mathematics release], bundle `Part C 2007 11.pdf`, pages 313–316. The Mathematics Part C paper was sat on 31 May 2010, 2.30–4.00pm.

Bounded exact-paper availability checks found no matching advertised answers. The general even-year release statement establishes coverage back to at least 2016 and does not itself establish this 2010 paper. All fourteen printed parts are addressed. Several literal source indexing and sign errors are retained in the private transcription and explained at their corresponding solutions.

